1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 24]</font>

15
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

16
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the dead of night.
Watch the candles.</font>

17
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

18
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you come here</font>

19
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you were worried about fire?</font>

20
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no time for games.</font>

21
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to tend your wounds.</font>

22
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

23
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

24
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two siblings really left, huh?</font>

25
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were drunk. I sent them home.</font>

26
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're all acting so strange.</font>

27
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:54,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Strange how?</font>

28
00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and my brother are strange.</font>

29
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we agree?</font>

30
00:01:58,780 --> 00:01:59,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once he's back,</font>

31
00:01:59,820 --> 00:02:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the three of us will be
just like before.</font>

32
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as he doesn't provoke me,</font>

33
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't bother with him.</font>

34
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just try to bear with it.</font>

35
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother just hasn't let go yet.</font>

36
00:02:18,740 --> 00:02:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Scratch my back for me.</font>

37
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little to the left.</font>

38
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, a little to the right.</font>

39
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's this?</font>

40
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that better?</font>

41
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it better like this?</font>

42
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's comfortable.</font>

43
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai?</font>

44
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:47,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

45
00:02:48,580 --> 00:02:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so late,</font>

46
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you and Prince Duan</font>

47
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are alone together in a room.</font>

48
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you worried about gossip?</font>

49
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The physician ordered</font>

50
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Prince's wound
must be dressed daily.</font>

51
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The servants are all asleep.</font>

52
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have quite the refined taste,</font>

53
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">standing outside my chamber door,</font>

54
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">eavesdropping.</font>

55
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

56
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't spoken of certain things,</font>

57
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it doesn't mean I've forgotten them.</font>

58
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you years ago</font>

59
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that if you failed Wei,
I wouldn't spare you.</font>

60
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know you did five years ago</font>

61
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your heart.</font>

62
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei may believe</font>

63
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the lies you've spun,</font>

64
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I do not.</font>

65
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:16,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To avoid any gossip</font>

66
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:17,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and unnecessary trouble,</font>

67
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a few days,</font>

68
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she and I will leave</font>

69
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and find another place to settle.</font>

70
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will heed your advice.</font>

71
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is my lawfully wedded wife.</font>

72
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her home is now here.</font>

73
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for you,</font>

74
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leave if you want.</font>

75
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

76
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am still applying medicine
for the Prince.</font>

77
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can discuss this matter later.</font>

78
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

79
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">allow me to apply the medicine
for the Prince.</font>

80
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

81
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:47,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, hold on.</font>

82
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pain will pass.</font>

83
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

84
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

85
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down.</font>

86
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't keep up.</font>

87
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mustn't tend his wounds again.</font>

88
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has many servants.</font>

89
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not your place to serve him.</font>

90
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen.</font>

91
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow,</font>

92
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll return to Guanzhou.</font>

93
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

94
00:04:10,620 --> 00:04:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be hasty.</font>

95
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince's wounds haven't healed.</font>

96
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't leave in good conscience.</font>

97
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait until the Prince recovers.</font>

98
00:04:17,460 --> 00:04:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't put me off.</font>

99
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow after tomorrow.</font>

100
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many tomorrows are there?</font>

101
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This whole ordeal is finally over.</font>

102
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and I can leave</font>

103
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these troubles behind and start anew.</font>

104
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that good?</font>

105
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I had hoped this new life</font>

106
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would include the Prince.</font>

107
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have made up your mind?</font>

108
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

109
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what's past</font>

110
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should be left in the past.</font>

111
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:44,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try, just for my sake.</font>

112
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please?</font>

113
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

114
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

115
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother!</font>

116
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

117
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still see everything</font>

118
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from five years ago
as if it were yesterday.</font>

119
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I simply let it go?</font>

120
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

121
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,</font>

122
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you scared me to death.</font>

123
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were just too absorbed.</font>

124
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been here a while,
and you didn't notice.</font>

125
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's on your mind?</font>

126
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't ask.</font>

127
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's an impossible question.</font>

128
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

129
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so clever.</font>

130
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure I can help you figure it out.</font>

131
00:06:02,940 --> 00:06:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When your brother</font>

132
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and your husband fall into the water,</font>

133
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who do you save first?</font>

134
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My husband, of course.</font>

135
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't even hesitate for a second.</font>

136
00:06:11,780 --> 00:06:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to hesitate about?</font>

137
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan can do the doggy paddle.</font>

138
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never mind.</font>

139
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:21,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come
looking for me so early?</font>

140
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who says I came looking for you?</font>

141
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

142
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to see Mobai.</font>

143
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he said he needs
to practice calligraphy</font>

144
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has no time for me.</font>

145
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother does practice every morning.</font>

146
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

147
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell me.</font>

148
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I fetch some copybooks
from my father's study</font>

149
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ask Mobai to teach me?</font>

150
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid my brother
won't have the time.</font>

151
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

152
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He and the Prince are at odds.</font>

153
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a few days, he might just</font>

154
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take me back to our hometown.</font>

155
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't do that!</font>

156
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew it.</font>

157
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brothers are truly</font>

158
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sent by the heavens</font>

159
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to ruin their sisters' romances.</font>

160
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:09,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But still,</font>

161
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you want them to reconcile,</font>

162
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is a way.</font>

163
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can act</font>

164
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as their go-between,</font>

165
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">earning goodwill from both sides.</font>

166
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the saying goes,</font>

167
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one does not hit a smiling face.</font>

168
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's always wise to cater
to their preferences.</font>

169
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:27,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once</font>

170
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they make up,</font>

171
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your staying here</font>

172
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be only natural.</font>

173
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that right?</font>

174
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am truly brilliant.</font>

175
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother,</font>

176
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're finally back!</font>

177
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You silly girl,</font>

178
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you forgotten me?</font>

179
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

180
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me have a look at you.</font>

181
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All dressed up,</font>

182
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you look completely different.</font>

183
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So beautiful.</font>

184
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your face looks slimmer too.</font>

185
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother,</font>

186
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have no idea</font>

187
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much I've missed you.</font>

188
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, you have to help me.</font>

189
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

190
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did that ill-tempered Prince</font>

191
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bully you again?</font>

192
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me,</font>

193
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'll go settle the score.</font>

194
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't bully me, exactly,</font>

195
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but there is one thing</font>

196
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that truly needs your intervention.</font>

197
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother and the Prince keep arguing.</font>

198
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must help me.</font>

199
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How hard can that be?</font>

200
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just trivial family squabbles.</font>

201
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm an expert</font>

202
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at this.</font>

203
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just watch and learn.</font>

204
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

205
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you were the best, Mother.</font>

206
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

207
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at these trees.</font>

208
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't the blossoms lovely?</font>

209
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one is wonderful.</font>

210
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly lovely.</font>

211
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this mansion is too vast.</font>

212
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My legs are aching
from all this walking.</font>

213
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me rub them for you, Mother.</font>

214
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll all stay with you.</font>

215
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A daughter's devotion is a blessing.</font>

216
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your brother,</font>

217
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">standing beside Prince Duan.</font>

218
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are a sight for sore eyes.</font>

219
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One a scholar, one a warrior.</font>

220
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One gentle, one firm.</font>

221
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A refined gentleman,</font>

222
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a born commander.</font>

223
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at these two.</font>

224
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They truly look like brothers.</font>

225
00:09:16,140 --> 00:09:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun, you flatter us.</font>

226
00:09:18,340 --> 00:09:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dare not presume such kinship.</font>

227
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

228
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please sit down.</font>

229
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please have a seat.</font>

230
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, my girl,</font>

231
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you sit too.</font>

232
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come now.</font>

233
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, please sit.</font>

234
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the pastries here</font>

235
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are so beautifully made.</font>

236
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother,</font>

237
00:09:34,580 --> 00:09:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">try one.</font>

238
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, the taste.</font>

239
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's truly delicious.</font>

240
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back in the day,</font>

241
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I first found this girl,</font>

242
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was as thin as a matchstick.</font>

243
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A truly pitiful sight.</font>

244
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would have thought</font>

245
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that today, she'd be living here,</font>

246
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">surrounded by maids and servants.</font>

247
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All thanks to your care.</font>

248
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heaven has truly blessed us.</font>

249
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your birth parents</font>

250
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knew you'd found such an ideal husband,</font>

251
00:10:16,420 --> 00:10:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll bet</font>

252
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'd be laughing in their sleep.</font>

253
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

254
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, let's not dwell on the past.</font>

255
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes, of course.</font>

256
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more talk of the past.</font>

257
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't mention it.</font>

258
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

259
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and your brother
have finally reunited.</font>

260
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To have such</font>

261
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a brother who dotes on you</font>

262
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a true blessing for you.</font>

263
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the old saying goes,</font>

264
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the elder brother is like a father.</font>

265
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

266
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you and Qinglan are wed,</font>

267
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must serve your brother-in-law</font>

268
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a cup of tea with respect.</font>

269
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather not drink</font>

270
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that cup of tea.</font>

271
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you not?</font>

272
00:10:56,980 --> 00:10:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan comes
from a prestigious family.</font>

273
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the time comes,</font>

274
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people will laugh at us.</font>

275
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes, a prestigious family</font>

276
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not as righteous as it seems.</font>

277
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Instead, they are prone</font>

278
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to acts of betrayal and treachery.</font>

279
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:10,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

280
00:11:12,540 --> 00:11:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I wrong?</font>

281
00:11:13,940 --> 00:11:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, his family,</font>

282
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under the guise of a marriage alliance,</font>

283
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">slaughtered our entire family.</font>

284
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If my sister had not narrowly escaped</font>

285
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">five years ago,</font>

286
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could we ever reunite?</font>

287
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My family was merely acting
on imperial orders.</font>

288
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a convenient phrase.</font>

289
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With just one phrase,</font>

290
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you absolved yourself of all blame,</font>

291
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cast aside the bond
between the two families,</font>

292
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and trampled upon Wei's devoted heart</font>

293
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without a second thought.</font>

294
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the whole story?</font>

295
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

296
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been wanting to say all this</font>

297
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since the moment you met, right?</font>

298
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Holding it in for so long,</font>

299
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've finally let it out.</font>

300
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had only longed for our reunion.</font>

301
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you two are at each other's throats,</font>

302
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">completely ignoring your past bond.</font>

303
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't you just talk it out?</font>

304
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Wei.
- Wei.</font>

305
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been patient time and again.</font>

306
00:11:54,580 --> 00:11:55,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the one bringing up old scores.</font>

307
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your conscience is clear,</font>

308
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why fear my bringing it up?</font>

309
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, please calm down first.</font>

310
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

311
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing you both like this,</font>

312
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather be dead!</font>

313
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:04,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll end my life right now to show you!</font>

314
00:12:05,820 --> 00:12:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

315
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I was wrong.
- I was wrong.</font>

316
00:12:07,180 --> 00:12:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both of you, step aside!</font>

317
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step aside!</font>

318
00:12:10,100 --> 00:12:11,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you do this?</font>

319
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pushing my daughter like this!</font>

320
00:12:13,820 --> 00:12:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heavens above!</font>

321
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, heavens!</font>

322
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you two</font>

323
00:12:20,060 --> 00:12:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bully a widow and her fatherless child?</font>

324
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are we supposed to live?</font>

325
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, merciful heaven!</font>

326
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must we suffer so pitifully?</font>

327
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you torment us so?</font>

328
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

329
00:12:35,620 --> 00:12:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our man watching Prince Duan's Mansion</font>

330
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reports</font>

331
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that since the Qin siblings</font>

332
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">moved into the mansion,</font>

333
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai</font>

334
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Prince Duan</font>

335
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been at each other's throats daily.</font>

336
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've turned the mansion</font>

337
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into utter chaos.</font>

338
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

339
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the blood feud between the two families</font>

340
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">remains far from resolved.</font>

341
00:12:58,060 --> 00:12:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them make a scene.</font>

342
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bigger the scene, the better.</font>

343
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'll take this one.
- Here you go.</font>

344
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one is nice.</font>

345
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

346
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sugar figurines!</font>

347
00:13:09,820 --> 00:13:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sugar figurines for sale!</font>

348
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

349
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you like a sugar figurine?</font>

350
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one do you like?</font>

351
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pick one yourself.</font>

352
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want this one.</font>

353
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

354
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, sir.</font>

355
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

356
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

357
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sugar figurine!</font>

358
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

359
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this sugar figurine for me?</font>

360
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love sugar figurines the most.</font>

361
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is for my sister.</font>

362
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have matters to attend to.</font>

363
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must take my leave now.</font>

364
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No treats, fine.</font>

365
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But why rush off so quickly?</font>

366
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still have questions for you.</font>

367
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you return the gifts</font>

368
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sent to your mansion last time?</font>

369
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you not like them?</font>

370
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I chose them with great care.</font>

371
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

372
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly appreciate your kindness.</font>

373
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But no merit, no reward.</font>

374
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the future, Miss Jiang,</font>

375
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please don't send any more gifts to me.</font>

376
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know about any merit or reward,</font>

377
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I do know one thing:</font>

378
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I see something fun or delicious,</font>

379
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always think of you</font>

380
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and want to share it with you.</font>

381
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thinking of your happiness</font>

382
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me even happier.</font>

383
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A friendship between gentlemen</font>

384
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is as pure as water.</font>

385
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you are Wei's friend,</font>

386
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will treat you</font>

387
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:21,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as a neighbor's little sister too.</font>

388
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing more.</font>

389
00:14:23,940 --> 00:14:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must ask you</font>

390
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to misunderstand my intentions.</font>

391
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye.</font>

392
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Same old trick.</font>

393
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:32,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trying to reject me.</font>

394
00:14:44,380 --> 00:14:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

395
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:46,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I bought you a sugar figurine.</font>

396
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want some?</font>

397
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About what happened today,</font>

398
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was my fault.</font>

399
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shouldn't have let my anger</font>

400
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get the better of my manners.</font>

401
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to scold me, just do it.</font>

402
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make yourself ill out of spite.</font>

403
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or our parents would be heartbroken.</font>

404
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can surely handle you two.</font>

405
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

406
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to tell you.</font>

407
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will count to three.</font>

408
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't open this door,</font>

409
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will kick it down.</font>

410
00:15:22,540 --> 00:15:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

411
00:15:24,100 --> 00:15:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two.</font>

412
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is still furious.</font>

413
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:28,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three.</font>

414
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As I told you,</font>

415
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will see no one.</font>

416
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Change your clothes tomorrow.</font>

417
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take you somewhere.</font>

418
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not going anywhere.</font>

419
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I say</font>

420
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:45,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it is to pay respects</font>

421
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your late parents?</font>

422
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Joint tomb of Su Siyun and Qin Minzhi]</font>

423
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:21,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Joint tomb of Su Siyun and Qin Minzhi]
Father, Mother,</font>

424
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:23,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sorry for this late visit.</font>

425
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our family has been granted amnesty.</font>

426
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you know this in the underworld,</font>

427
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may finally rest in peace.</font>

428
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, Mother, rest assured.</font>

429
00:16:38,380 --> 00:16:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will protect Wei with my life.</font>

430
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let her suffer any more harm.</font>

431
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please bless us from above</font>

432
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we may never be parted again.</font>

433
00:16:57,960 --> 00:17:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Imperial Prison]</font>

434
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you now believe my words?</font>

435
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the critical affair</font>

436
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">concerning Beiyuan?</font>

437
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me,</font>

438
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I will spare your life.</font>

439
00:17:17,740 --> 00:17:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very well.</font>

440
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:20,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust you.</font>

441
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your word is as good as gold.</font>

442
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will surely help me.</font>

443
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

444
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

445
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

446
00:17:39,670 --> 00:17:43,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

447
00:17:44,350 --> 00:17:47,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

448
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

449
00:17:52,850 --> 00:17:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

450
00:17:57,190 --> 00:18:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

451
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:09,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

452
00:18:09,990 --> 00:18:13,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

453
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:18,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

454
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

455
00:18:22,570 --> 00:18:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

456
00:18:27,170 --> 00:18:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
